r><tr><td><a href=\"CodeSystem-HIVConcepts.html#HIVConcepts-HIV.46H.46DE28\">HIV.H.DE28</a></td><td>Not located</td><td>Attempt was made to locate client, but client was not found</td></tr><tr><td><a href=\"CodeSystem-HIVConcepts.html#HIVConcepts-HIV.46H.46DE29\">HIV.H.DE29</a></td><td>Died (reported)</td><td>The client was reported as having died</td></tr></table></li></ul></div>"
